@startuml
title Exam submission - durable receipt and retry
actor Student
participant "Browser/IndexedDB" as Browser
participant "Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Core API" as API
database "Tenant DB" as DB
participant "Exam worker" as Worker
Student -> Browser : answer/submit
Browser -> Browser : persist local draft + key + seq
Browser -> Gateway : POST submission (HTTPS)
Gateway -> API : verified tenant context
API -> DB : INSERT receipt idempotently (SQL)
DB --> API : COMMIT
API --> Browser : 202 receipt
Browser -> Browser : mark server saved
Worker -> DB : poll pending (SQL)
Worker -> DB : grade, mark processed
note bottom
  If network/API fails before 202, Browser retries same key.
  API restart after COMMIT cannot erase receipt.
  Worker processing is asynchronous; no grade promise in 202.
end note
@enduml
